+# Review
+
+- `src/shopcore/inventory.py:139` - Reservations are created one SKU at a time, so when a later SKU is short the earlier ones remain held; the batch is not atomic.
+- `src/shopcore/inventory.py:166` - `remaining = items` aliases the caller's dict, so the caller's cart is decremented in place.
+- `src/shopcore/inventory.py:185` - Uses `datetime.now(UTC)` instead of the injected clock, so partial reservations expire on wall-clock time.
